  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The University of Winchester is a public research university in the county of Hampshire, England. The university's main campus is within walking distance of the historical city of Winchester and has been redeveloped and modernised in recent years.</p><p>With strong teaching quality and student satisfaction, Winchester offers undergraduate, postgraduate, and research programmes across arts, sciences, business, education, health, humanities, and more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Winchester gives you a campus with a friendly community of international students. You can explore the city centre nearby, which is just a short walk from the campus. Not just that, there are lots of clubs and societies you can join. Plus, you also have dedicated teams to assist with academic support, career advice, and more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Winchester offers a range of modern and comfortable accommodation options on campus. You can choose from various types, including on-campus villages, residence halls, and en-suite rooms. Most residences are within a 10–15 minute walk of teaching buildings, services, and the city centre.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>You’ll have access to a well-resourced library with study spaces and research support.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>Sports are a big part of life at the University of Winchester. You can try out lots of different sports, from Jiu Jitsu and Quidditch to basketball, and there are great facilities too, including a three-court sports hall and plenty of clubs and activities to get involved in.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>You’ll also find multiple lab facilities, including specialised ones.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>The university’s dining facilities include food halls, cafes, and social spaces.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
